# Domain names! Put your domain names here!
# Each line generates a new key and certificate.
# The first domain on a line is the primary name in the certificate.
# If multiple domains are on one line, they are added as extra names.

# Always verify your config by running `uv run lematt --test` first.
# Run `uv run lematt --test` after every change to verify your options still work.
# Production rate limits are low (5 certificates per exact set of names
# per 7 days, and each line issues RSA + EC); repeatedly testing against
# --prod can lock a domain out for days.

# Examples:
# example.com www
# mail.example.com
# dev.example.com dev2.example.com dev3.example.com
# corp.example.com internal hr chat git web pikachu
# fast.example.com profile=shortlived
#
# Comments must be on their own line; anything after a name is read as
# another name.
